   1569  fa26							; Conn table lives in bank2; the fold read happens in the bank0 CALLER's
   1570  fa26							; jsr FoldIndirect after return. C4 2026-10-20: the table address is the level
   1571  fa26							; block's +2n (n = LevelRoomN), so no pointer word is stored per level.
   1572  fa26							; Returns Y = RoomNo*2 (2 packed bytes per room: up/down, left/right), X = 0.
