   1729  fae9							; X = x+1 here — buffer dispatch still selects correctly (pair x is
   1730  fae9							; even: PF0 iff x<4 ⟺ X<4; PF1 4..10 ⟺ X 5..11; PF2 x≥12 ⟺ X≥13).
   1731  fae9		       a4 84		      ldy	LineCount
