   2082  fcc3							; Bit masks for IsRoomDark/SetRoomDark. Index 4+room for EnemyRamD
   2083  fcc3							; (rooms 0-3 → bits 4-7); index = room for LaserState (rooms 4-7 →
   2084  fcc3							; bits 4-7 of the table, lsr×2 down to bits 2-5 = LaserState spare).
   2085  fcc3				   BitMaskTable
   2086  fcc3		       01 02 04 08*	      .byte.b	$01, $02, $04, $08, $10, $20, $40, $80
