   2405  fe22							; nobody over the raft: PARK it (no motion) and clear the ramp state so the
   2406  fe22							; next take-off ramps again; the bomb count in b2-0 is preserved
   2407  fe22		       a5 f0		      lda	$F0
   2408  fe24		       29 07		      and	#%00000111
   2409  fe26		       85 f0		      sta	$F0
